  "Replicator only picks from enabled resources with the current highest valid priority (or -1 priority). After that, replicator use is split between resources of identical weighting. Setting configures how that split happens.": "复制器只从当前最高有效优先级（或 -1 优先级）的已启用资源中选择。之后，复制器的使用会按相同权重的资源进行分配。此设置用于配置分配方式。",
  "Projects will be weighted and build in this steps. Increasing number can speed up constructing. Step will be adjusted down when preferred step above remaining amount, or surpass storage caps. Weightings below will be multiplied by current step. Projects builded by triggers will always have maximum possible step.": "项目将按此步数加权并建造。增大数字可加快建造。当首选步数超过剩余数量或存储上限时，步数将自动下调。下方权重将乘以当前步数。由触发器建造的项目将始终使用最大可能的步数。",
  "Available placeholders: {resetType}, {species}, {timestamp} (in game days). Use {eval: XXX } to log custom information": "可用占位符：{resetType}、{species}、{timestamp}（游戏天数）。使用 {eval: XXX } 记录自定义信息",
  "Projects weighting scales with current progress, making script more eager to spend resources on finishing nearly constructed projects.": "项目权重随当前进度缩放，使脚本更愿意投入资源完成接近完工的项目。",
  "Automatically turns off the hell patrol and surveyor log messages": "自动关闭地狱巡逻和侦察员日志消息。",
  "Spends more time on resources that are easy to replicate. A resource with 2x the weighting will have roughly 2x the time spent. Based on differences in atomic mass, resources at similar weightings may have very different quantities.": "在易于复制的资源上花费更多时间。权重为 2 倍的资源将大约花费 2 倍的时间。由于原子质量差异，权重相近的资源数量可能相差很大。",
  "Spends more time on resources that are hard to replicate. A resource with 2x the weighting will be focused until you have roughly 2x the amount. Resources at similar weightings will have similar quantities.": "在难以复制的资源上花费更多时间。权重为 2 倍的资源将持续受到关注，直到你拥有约 2 倍的数量。权重相近的资源数量也相近。",
  "Legacy mode, similar to previous script behavior. Only the resource with the highest weighting is picked. If multiple resources have the same weighting then it will focus exclusively on one of those resources. This mode exists only to give you time to migrate your config to using the priority field.": "旧版模式，与之前脚本行为类似。只选择权重最高的资源。如果多个资源权重相同，则只专注于其中一个。此模式仅用于给你时间将配置迁移到使用优先级字段。"
